<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-News to float Digital Media Services.</title>
<headline>RTRS-News to float Digital Media Services.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>News Corp Ltd chairman and chief executive Rupert Murdoch said on Tuesday that the company planned to float 20 percent of its Digital Media Services operation within two to three weeks.</p>
</text>
